WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,600
Since I summoned you, please abide by the rules here.

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:06,050
I understand, master

3
00:00:06,050 --> 00:00:11,961
It can be recovered if it has an entity

4
00:00:11,961 --> 00:00:21,250
They are different from the heroic spirits summoned by political achievements.

5
00:00:21,250 --> 00:00:25,490
Hit the dog, fight!

6
00:00:25,490 --> 00:00:29,930
I hate people calling me dog

7
00:00:29,930 --> 00:00:36,175
Poetry is strength

8
00:00:36,175 --> 00:00:43,670
That's enough
